mailed to the contact person listed here for review before they are printed in the Sample","x":263,"y":2760,"w":1984,"h":42},{"text":"Ballot & Official Voter Information Pamphlets.","x":839,"y":2806,"w":834,"h":40},{"text":"Please complete the reverse side of this form.","x":837,"y":2855,"w":838,"h":39},{"text":"40 Tower Road, San Mateo, CA 94402","x":895,"y":2902,"w":722,"h":41},{"text":"P 650.312.5222 F 650.312.5348 email registrar@smcacre.gov web www.smcacre.gov","x":424,"y":2952,"w":1666,"h":46}]},{"page":2,"width":2448,"height":3168,"lines":[{"text":"Primary Argument Signers Form","x":738,"y":249,"w":591,"h":45},{"text":"No more than five signatures shall appear with any argument. If more than five signatures","x":253,"y":298,"w":1531,"h":58},{"text":"are submitted, the first five listed shall be printed. Names and titles listed will be printed in","x":254,"y":341,"w":1528,"h":60},{"text":"the order that they are listed below. Place a checkmark in the author column if the signer is","x":254,"y":385,"w":1556,"h":62},{"text":"the author of the argument. A signer can only list one title. Honorifics such as M.D., Dr.,","x":255,"y":431,"w":1504,"h":58},{"text":"Esquire, etc. with a name are not accepted.","x":257,"y":489,"w":734,"h":49},{"text":"If the signers are part of a bona fide association, there Is no requirement that they be","x":260,"y":543,"w":1437,"h":62},{"text":"eligible to vote on the measure. However, for each such signing individual, the title under","x":259,"y":586,"w":1519,"h":63},{"text":"the signer's name must list the name of that bona fide association and may include their","x":260,"y":631,"w":1493,"h":61},{"text":"position within that assoclatlon.","x":262,"y":693,"w":526,"h":46},{"text":"By signing below, the undersigned state that they have read the argument and believe it not","x":263,"y":743,"w":1559,"h":65},{"text":"Author","x":1872,"y":235,"w":126,"h":31},{"text":"Verified","x":2063,"y":231,"w":144,"h":31},{"text":"o","x":2131,"y":331,"w